      "arguments": {
        "content": "# Product comparison\n\n## Summary table\n\n| Product | Price | Project limit | Retention | Export |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| Atlas | 120 USD | 40 projects | 7 days | CSV |\n| Birch | 180 USD | 75 projects | 14 days | JSON |\n| Cedar | 240 USD | 90 projects | 30 days | XML |\n\n## Recommendation\n\n**Cedar** is the best overall choice if you want the highest project limit and longest retention, though it is also the most expensive. **Atlas** is the lowest-cost option, while **Birch** sits in the middle with moderate pricing and capacity.\n\n## Citations\n\n- Atlas: Price 120 USD; limit 40 projects; retention 7 days; export CSV. [Source](http://127.0.0.1:61910/atlas)\n- Birch: Price 180 USD; limit 75 projects; retention 14 days; export JSON. [Source](http://127.0.0.1:61910/birch)\n- Cedar: Price 240 USD; limit 90 projects; retention 30 days; export XML. [Source](http://127.0.0.1:61910/cedar)\n",
